---
source: crates/safix/src/reporter.rs
expression: render_plain(&refusal)
---
safix: the mapping 'ntfy-token' exports ntfy-token for alice, and secrets/safix/users/alice/secrets.yaml did not
decrypt. sops has said why, above this.

The mapping is refused rather than transferred. A value that cannot be
read cannot be verified, and pushing an unverifiable value into another
store is worse than not pushing it.
